{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 4747231455258351282,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Async I/O Evolution",
      "source_hash": 11737855843739150213,
      "context_hash": 721125816448322182,
      "translation": "비동기 I/O의 발전",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753555Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "From POSIX AIO to Linux AIO to io_uring",
      "source_hash": 9281896522394259332,
      "context_hash": 16793447530625634584,
      "translation": "POSIX AIO에서 Linux AIO, 그리고 io_uring까지",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "AIO": "AIO",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "POSIX": "POSIX"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753555Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The problem with synchronous I/O",
      "source_hash": 11766937425862687427,
      "context_hash": 445429559716529281,
      "translation": "동기 I/O의 문제점",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753555Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Synchronous `read()`/`write()` block the calling thread until data is transferred.",
      "source_hash": 13040298190361663239,
      "context_hash": 2073917070854259142,
      "translation": "동기 `read()`/`write()`는 데이터 전송이 끝날 때까지 호출한 스레드를 블록합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753555Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "For high-throughput servers this means either:",
      "source_hash": 1212722140805990307,
      "context_hash": 12064328984008031737,
      "translation": "처리량이 높은 서버에서는 다음 둘 중 하나를 의미합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "throughput": "처리량"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753555Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Many threads (each blocking on I/O) — high memory cost, context switch overhead",
      "source_hash": 11705007892311912483,
      "context_hash": 1397096871205655292,
      "translation": "많은 스레드(각각 I/O에서 블록됨) — 높은 메모리 비용, 컨텍스트 스위치 오버헤드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "context switch": "컨텍스트 스위치",
        "memory": "메모리",
        "overhead": "오버헤드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753555Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Non-blocking I/O with `epoll` — works for sockets, but **epoll does not work for regular files** (they are always \"ready\")",
      "source_hash": 17228323901911256583,
      "context_hash": 1817562730348879897,
      "translation": "`epoll`을 사용한 논블로킹 I/O — 소켓에는 동작하지만 **epoll은 일반 파일에는 동작하지 않음**(일반 파일은 항상 \"준비됨\" 상태)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "epoll": "epoll"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753556Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The goal of async I/O: submit I/O, do other work, collect results when ready.",
      "source_hash": 4988068521603977538,
      "context_hash": 12623710147425202820,
      "translation": "비동기 I/O의 목표는 I/O를 제출하고, 다른 작업을 수행한 뒤, 준비되면 결과를 수집하는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753556Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "POSIX AIO (glibc userspace)",
      "source_hash": 10343547446533491250,
      "context_hash": 12938915195990246916,
      "translation": "POSIX AIO(glibc 사용자 공간)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "AIO": "AIO",
        "POSIX": "POSIX",
        "glibc": "glibc",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753556Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "POSIX AIO (`aio_read`, `aio_write`) is the standard API — but the Linux glibc implementation fakes it with threads:",
      "source_hash": 7744532382433880610,
      "context_hash": 12148731047024958536,
      "translation": "POSIX AIO(`aio_read`, `aio_write`)는 표준 API이지만, Linux glibc 구현은 이를 스레드로 흉내 냅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "AIO": "AIO",
        "API": "API",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "POSIX": "POSIX",
        "glibc": "glibc"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753556Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**The problem**: glibc implements POSIX AIO using a thread pool.",
      "source_hash": 8894288501138336349,
      "context_hash": 6612688172333288761,
      "translation": "**문제점**: glibc는 스레드 풀을 사용해 POSIX AIO를 구현합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "AIO": "AIO",
        "POSIX": "POSIX",
        "glibc": "glibc",
        "pool": "풀"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753556Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Each `aio_read()` submits work to a worker thread that calls `pread()` synchronously.",
      "source_hash": 9587428524069164653,
      "context_hash": 12922619154095198092,
      "translation": "각 `aio_read()`는 `pread()`를 동기적으로 호출하는 워커 스레드에 작업을 제출합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753556Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "This adds:",
      "source_hash": 7722261662370824562,
      "context_hash": 9414418675621297022,
      "translation": "이로 인해 다음이 추가됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753556Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Thread creation/teardown overhead",
      "source_hash": 11852550038273233978,
      "context_hash": 11595053673694674208,
      "translation": "스레드 생성/해제 오버헤드",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "overhead": "오버헤드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753556Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Memory per thread (stack)",
      "source_hash": 9696501185043825251,
      "context_hash": 12478261687860465150,
      "translation": "스레드별 메모리(스택)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753556Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Context switches to the worker thread and back",
      "source_hash": 4993463471017503563,
      "context_hash": 9346400229870449606,
      "translation": "워커 스레드로 갔다가 돌아오는 컨텍스트 스위치",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "context switches": "컨텍스트 스위치"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753556Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "No kernel bypass — still goes through the kernel per-thread",
      "source_hash": 16974125788901689974,
      "context_hash": 4494760286807528882,
      "translation": "커널 우회 없음 — 여전히 스레드마다 커널을 거침",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753557Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Linux Kernel AIO",
      "source_hash": 18329058481773328157,
      "context_hash": 17093606176331172043,
      "translation": "Linux 커널 AIO",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "AIO": "AIO",
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753557Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Linux added native async I/O in 2.6 (`io_submit`, `io_getevents`).",
      "source_hash": 17626181090080518359,
      "context_hash": 12786847876612899910,
      "translation": "Linux는 2.6에서 네이티브 비동기 I/O(`io_submit`, `io_getevents`)를 추가했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753557Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Unlike POSIX AIO, this runs in the kernel — no threads.",
      "source_hash": 6299098368210337398,
      "context_hash": 11897873525266351094,
      "translation": "POSIX AIO와 달리 이는 커널 안에서 실행되며, 스레드를 사용하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "AIO": "AIO",
        "POSIX": "POSIX",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753557Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Linux AIO limitations",
      "source_hash": 12719994557246394826,
      "context_hash": 4951246706847071261,
      "translation": "Linux AIO의 한계",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "AIO": "AIO",
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753557Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Linux AIO was designed specifically for `O_DIRECT` I/O.",
      "source_hash": 10798862068440357483,
      "context_hash": 6172460383513677777,
      "translation": "Linux AIO는 `O_DIRECT` I/O 전용으로 설계되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "AIO": "AIO",
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753557Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "It has serious limitations:",
      "source_hash": 3946612879944169247,
      "context_hash": 11615125904417078126,
      "translation": "여기에는 심각한 한계가 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753557Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Limitation",
      "source_hash": 18373232533281084720,
      "context_hash": 14183922465744398953,
      "translation": "한계",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753557Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Details",
      "source_hash": 16323164173667568678,
      "context_hash": 3493219303092923639,
      "translation": "상세",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Details": "상세"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:28:11.389362Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "**O_DIRECT only**",
      "source_hash": 14840706825142909934,
      "context_hash": 1240164897595321453,
      "translation": "**O_DIRECT 전용**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "O_DIRECT only": "O_DIRECT 전용"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753557Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Buffered I/O submits synchronously even with `io_submit`",
      "source_hash": 14519436221773985754,
      "context_hash": 6566540269205192825,
      "translation": "버퍼드 I/O는 `io_submit`을 사용해도 동기적으로 제출됨",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753557Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "**No network sockets**",
      "source_hash": 16606122812404933436,
      "context_hash": 17266471570675288270,
      "translation": "**네트워크 소켓 미지원**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753557Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Only block/file I/O, not sockets or pipes",
      "source_hash": 214353963220654712,
      "context_hash": 3218770486532124492,
      "translation": "블록/파일 I/O만 지원하며 소켓이나 파이프는 미지원",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753557Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "**io_submit can block**",
      "source_hash": 3447258314072814585,
      "context_hash": 11317392876265969297,
      "translation": "**io_submit이 블록될 수 있음**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753558Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "On buffered files or full submission ring",
      "source_hash": 12172211690338940037,
      "context_hash": 16015686927502394326,
      "translation": "버퍼드 파일 또는 제출 링이 가득 찬 경우",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753558Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "**No fixed buffers**",
      "source_hash": 11780458842976100314,
      "context_hash": 14598095386103078676,
      "translation": "**고정 버퍼 없음**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "fixed buffers": "고정 버퍼"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:34.753558Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "Each op requires mapping/unmapping user buffers",
      "source_hash": 2446721241388109570,
      "context_hash": 4229680913802412994,
      "translation": "연산마다 사용자 버퍼를 매핑/언매핑해야 합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "mapping": "매핑"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:37.827139Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "**No chaining**",
      "source_hash": 10602621852419701566,
      "context_hash": 16661990017955517810,
      "translation": "**체이닝 불가**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:37.827139Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "Can't express \"read A, then write B\" without round-tripping to userspace",
      "source_hash": 11732230796958687530,
      "context_hash": 6071006418950500967,
      "translation": "사용자 공간을 왕복하지 않고는 \"A를 읽은 다음 B를 쓰기\"를 표현할 수 없습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:37.827139Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "**No fsync**",
      "source_hash": 3291307369425317110,
      "context_hash": 9569152665408757116,
      "translation": "**fsync 불가**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:37.827140Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "`IOCB_CMD_FSYNC` exists but rarely works async",
      "source_hash": 2606081255825317840,
      "context_hash": 10849029609580251683,
      "translation": "`IOCB_CMD_FSYNC`가 존재하지만 비동기로 동작하는 경우가 드뭅니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:37.827140Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "The result: Linux AIO only helps databases already using `O_DIRECT`.",
      "source_hash": 7118269132637449590,
      "context_hash": 16229943850456834084,
      "translation": "결과적으로 Linux AIO는 이미 `O_DIRECT`를 사용하는 데이터베이스에만 도움이 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "AIO": "AIO",
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:37.827140Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:19/seg:1",
      "source": "It does not solve the general async I/O problem.",
      "source_hash": 9246037651696086845,
      "context_hash": 7885510996094400261,
      "translation": "일반적인 비동기 I/O 문제는 해결하지 못합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:37.827140Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:20/seg:0",
      "source": "Kernel path for Linux AIO",
      "source_hash": 5948878161480644661,
      "context_hash": 10756284482206412140,
      "translation": "Linux AIO의 커널 경로",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "AIO": "AIO",
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:37.827140Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "io_uring: solving the problem properly",
      "source_hash": 11108526649455435291,
      "context_hash": 10739341256984072911,
      "translation": "io_uring: 문제의 제대로 된 해결",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:37.827140Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "`io_uring` (merged in Linux 5.1, 2019) addresses all Linux AIO limitations.",
      "source_hash": 18342999460639658953,
      "context_hash": 9571720051861601917,
      "translation": "`io_uring`(2019년 Linux 5.1에 병합)은 Linux AIO의 모든 한계를 해결합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "AIO": "AIO",
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:37.827141Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It uses two shared-memory ring buffers between kernel and userspace:",
      "source_hash": 6740069744530996750,
      "context_hash": 15676982292545229132,
      "translation": "커널과 사용자 공간 사이에 두 개의 공유 메모리 링 버퍼를 사용합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "memory": "메모리",
        "ring buffers": "링 버퍼",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:37.827141Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "No locking needed: SQ tail is written by userspace, SQ head by kernel; CQ tail by kernel, CQ head by userspace.",
      "source_hash": 10542779277303996937,
      "context_hash": 3013365746054951142,
      "translation": "락이 필요 없습니다: SQ tail은 사용자 공간이, SQ head는 커널이 쓰고, CQ tail은 커널이, CQ head는 사용자 공간이 씁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:37.827141Z",
      "issues": []
